{"ID":"20240205153803-0hqg7mt","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153803-0hqg7mt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153803-0hqg7mt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111123-ywo908a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205160922-rdgrzjl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111123-ywo908a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:259,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:259\u0026#125;","title":"蕲蛇（五步蛇、尖吻蝮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902173038"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206111123-ywo908a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111123-ywo908a","updated":"20240206111131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江西、福建、浙江、湖南等地。\n【性状】\t本品卷呈圆盘状，盘经1734cm，体长可达2m。头在中间稍向上，呈三角形而扁平，吻端向上。上腭有管状毒牙，中空尖锐。背部两侧各有黑褐色与浅棕色组成的“V”形斑纹1725个，其“V”形的两上端在背中线上相接，有的左右不相接，呈交错排列。腹部撑开或不撑开，灰白色，鳞片较大，有黑色类圆形的斑点；腹内壁黄白色，脊椎骨的棘突较高，呈刀片状上突，前后椎体下突基本同形，多为弯刀状，向后倾斜，尖端明显超过椎体后隆面。尾部骤细，末端有三角形深灰色的角质鳞片1枚。气腥，味微咸。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，温。\n【功效】\t祛风，通络，止痉。用于风湿顽痹，麻木拘挛，中风口眼歪斜，半身不遂，抽搐痉挛，破伤风，麻风疥癣。\n【注解】\t“龙头虎口”：指蕲蛇头部呈扁平三角形，鼻尖向上，口较宽大，犹如龙头虎口。\n“方胜纹”：指蕲蛇背部两侧各有的黑褐色与浅棕色组成的V形大斑纹17"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"24个，其斑纹顶端在背中线上相接，形似古代书生的方胜帽形状。\n“念珠斑”：指蕲蛇白色腹部上杂有多数黑色类圆形斑点。\n“佛指甲”：指蕲蛇尾部渐细，末端呈扁三角形，角质而硬，形如佛之指甲。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111123-spjw44g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111123-spjw44g","updated":"20240206111123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111123-s53ofcy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160922-rdgrzjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160922-rdgrzjl","updated":"20240205160922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕲蛇"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕲蛇-20240205160922-ebeh3qg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725083227-om2pfj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725083227-om2pfj1","updated":"20240725083313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕲蛇 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕲蛇 1-20240725083227-qhzi20z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 573px;","style":"width: 563px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕲蛇 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕲蛇 2-20240725083313-q6b6q27.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 563px;\" parent-style=\"width: 573px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725083130-ndyuk4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725083130-ndyuk4h","updated":"20240725084224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 640px;","style":"width: 630px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"尖吻蝮 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/尖吻蝮 2-20240725084115-90rcb9y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 630px;\" parent-style=\"width: 640px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蕲蛇 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蕲蛇 3-20240725083447-we33bmg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725083918-xjfgq4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725083918-xjfgq4l","updated":"20240725084015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 625px;","style":"width: 615px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"尖吻蝮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/尖吻蝮-20240725083918-32m0hlq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 615px;\" parent-style=\"width: 625px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"尖吻蝮 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/尖吻蝮 1-20240725084015-c6mslrl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240725084220-lz68wqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725084220-lz68wqb","updated":"20240725084735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 608px;","style":"width: 598px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"尖吻蝮 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/尖吻蝮 3-20240725084157-n6mw86r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 598px;\" parent-style=\"width: 608px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"尖吻蝮 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/尖吻蝮 5-20240725084735-347gy3z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240725084201-urboxwd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240725084201-urboxwd"}},{"ID":"20240725084203-gt638gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240725084203-gt638gt","updated":"20240902172923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蕲蛇"}]},{"ID":"20240902172924-cf7c1e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172924-cf7c1e4","updated":"20240902173029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味：味甘、咸，性温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902172929-hdgw4ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172929-hdgw4ag","updated":"20240902173032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经：肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902172931-ibmymg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172931-ibmymg3","updated":"20240902173035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能：有祛风，通络，止痉的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902172933-6nnkggf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172933-6nnkggf","updated":"20240902173038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：用于风湿顽痹，麻木拘挛，中风口眼斜，半身不遂，抽搐痉挛，破伤风，麻风，疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902172936-yjzhkum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172936-yjzhkum","updated":"20240902172945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相关配伍："}]},{"ID":"20240902172945-iutj6op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172945-iutj6op","updated":"20240902173004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、风湿顽痹，中风半身不遂。本品具走窜之性，性温通络，能内走脏腑，外达肌表而透骨搜风，以袪内外之风邪，为截风要药，又能通经络，凡风湿痹证无不宜之，尤善治病深日久之风湿顽痹，经络不通，麻木拘挛，以及中风口眼斜，半身不遂者，常与防风、羌活、当归等配伍，如白花蛇酒。(《濒湖集简方》)\n2、小儿惊风，破伤风。本品入肝，既能祛外风，又能息内风，风去则惊搐自定，为治抽搐痉挛常用药。治小儿急慢惊风、破伤风之抽搐痉挛，多与乌梢蛇、蜈蚣同用，如定命散。(《圣济总录》)\n3、治疥癣，可与荆芥、薄荷、天麻同用，如驱风膏。(《医垒元戎》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902173005-4ijt533","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173005-4ijt533","updated":"20240902173011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相关论述："}]},{"ID":"20240902173012-kfgsf3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173012-kfgsf3f","updated":"20240902173019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、《雷公炮炙论》：治风。引药至于有风疾处。\n2、《开宝本草》：主中风湿痹不仁，筋脉拘急，口面喎斜，半身不遂，骨节疼痛，大风疥癞及暴风瘙痒，脚弱不能久立。\n3、《本草纲目》：能透骨搜风，截惊定搐，为风痹、惊搐、癞癣、恶疮要药，取其内走脏腑，外彻皮肤，无处不到也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902172919-2wbvkqz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902172919-2wbvkqz"}},{"ID":"20240902172919-n3hepnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902172919-n3hepnw"}}]}